{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_149_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，衞北宮括帥師侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"二、夏，公會尹子、單子、晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、邾人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"三、六月，乙酉，同盟於柯陵。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"柯陵之盟，謀復伐鄭也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"四、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"不曰至自伐鄭也，公不周乎伐鄭也。何以知公之不周乎伐鄭？以其以會致也。何以知其盟復伐鄭也？以其後會之人盡盟者也。不周乎伐鄭，則何為日也？言公之不背柯陵之盟也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"五、齊高無咎出奔莒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"六、九月，辛丑，用郊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"夏之始可以承春，以秋之末，承春之始，蓋不可矣。九月用郊，用者，不宜用也。宮室不設，不可以祭；衣服不脩，不可以祭；車馬器械不備，不可以祭；有司一人不備其職，不可以祭。祭者，薦其時也，薦其敬也，薦其美也，非享味也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"七、晉侯使荀罃來乞師。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"八、冬，公會單子、晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、齊人、邾人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"言公不背柯陵之盟也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"九、十有一月，公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"十、壬申，公孫嬰齊卒於貍蜃。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"十一月無壬申，壬申乃十月也。致公而後錄，臣子之義。其地，未踰竟也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"十一、十有二月，丁巳，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"十二、邾子貜且卒。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"十三、晉殺其大夫郤錡、郤犨、郤至。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_19","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"自禍於是起矣。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_clt_149_20","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_149","textTraditional":"十四、楚人滅舒庸。","sentenceOrder":20}],"overrides":{}}